<title>DUBAI: Dubai silver re-exports to India down in Jan.</title>
<headline>Dubai silver re-exports to India down in Jan.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Silver re-exports from the Gulf Arab emirate of Dubai to India fell to 20.52 tonnes in January from 48.46 tonnes the previous month, according to figures complied by the statistics section of Dubai customs.</p>
<p>Re-exports to Pakistan last month reached 2.81 tonnes from zero in December 1996, the figures showed.</p>
</text>
